    InvokE is `'('- NamE? ')'-` -- a NamE, not an ExpressioN -- so this file
    tries the shapes that could reach it: empty parens, a bare name in parens,
    at statement position where RunRulE `NamE InvokE? ';'-?` governs.

    Read the stderr with the gate open and grep for `lab=InvokE`. Absence is
    the finding, and it is a finding either way.  */
Start();
registry(cOMMANDs);
define traceParse immediateAction=traceParse; ;
traceParse();
register(InvokeE);
